# Works

Follow `README.md`. It is the grammar for this repo.

A work is `shelf/slug.md` or `shelf/slug/index.md`. The catalog block goes only on that file. Part files have no front matter and must not open with a `---` line.

Write keys in this order:

```yaml
---
title: The Glass Harbor
description: A diver finds the town's name written on the hull.
form: short-story
status: draft
languages:
  - en
tags:
  - sea
published: false
---
```

`published` is always the unquoted boolean `true` or `false`. `completed` is present only when `status` is `done`. `description` is required when `published` is true.

After changing a work or the grammar, run `ruby script/validate.rb` from the repo root. A grammar change updates `README.md` and `script/validate.rb` in the same change.
